     read as an income claim - see APPROVED-COPY 2026-08-23. #}
  <p class="counted-strip" id="countedStrip" hidden>You just counted <span id="countedHours"></span> hours a year.</p>

  {# LIVE since 2026-08-26. Hook callback: repeats the ad's own opening so the person
     can see they landed where they were going. Hidden unless utm_content names a known
     hook, so organic and crawlers never see it. a2 is deliberately absent - the H1
     itself now carries "years" and "lazy". #}
