  {# LIVE since 2026-08-27. The nearest bookable session, read from wr-slots - the same
     source the schedule step reads, so this page can never promise a session the next
     screen does not offer. Stays hidden until the fetch answers: a countdown rendered
     before it knows the time would show a wrong number for a second, and a crawler
     would index a timer that is not running. #}
  <p class="next-session" id="nextSession" hidden>Next session starts in <span class="next-session-clock" id="nextSessionClock"></span></p>

