    <p id="formError" style="color:var(--error);font-size:0.8rem;margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em;"></p>
  </form>

  {# LIVE since 2026-08-27. Ties the first-person ad ("How I found what was actually
     running out") to the address they are about to hand over - the video says "I",
     the form should say who. First name only: the site has used "Kirill" everywhere
